        "bookingUrl": "https://www.booking.com/hotel/pe/antigua-miraflores.fr.html?aid=304142&label=gen173nr-10CAQoggJCC3NlYXJjaF9saW1hSA1YBGhNiAEBmAEzuAEXyAEM2AED6AEB-AEBiAIBqAIBuAKYmMTPBsACAdICJDNjZGYxZGM2LTZlM2QtNGNkOC1iODEzLWM1NWU5ZDc0MDdiYtgCAeACAQ&ucfs=1&arphpl=1&checkin=2026-06-15&checkout=2026-06-16&group_adults=2&req_adults=2&no_rooms=1&group_children=0&req_children=0&hpos=5&hapos=5&sr_order=popularity&nflt=review_score%3D90&srpvid=c82689cc7bca045f&srepoch=1777404956&all_sr_blocks=23864212_210793091_2_41_0&highlighted_blocks=23864212_210793091_2_41_0&matching_block_id=23864212_210793091_2_41_0&sr_pri_blocks=23864212_210793091_2_41_0__11001&from=searchresults",
        "imageUrl": "https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max1024x768/144190328.jpg?k=babf854b4b7d007c3c2dd3256801c27d7b87b55ee5f249635d26f3646e473e0a&o=",
        "imageUrl2": "https://cf.bstatic.com/xdata/images/hotel/max500/138635316.jpg?k=a87570e5071f7e32efcf664da8dab5c4914045f1d1cddfc2c685b6ca04ef0458&o=",
        "description_fr": "L'Hotel Antigua Miraflores propose gratuitement une connexion Wi-Fi et un parking. Il vous accueille à proximité du Parque del Amor et du Parque Central de Miraflores avec ses spectacles folkloriques nocturnes, à côté de la plage de Waikiki, le long de l'océan Pacifique Sud.\nL'Hotel Antigua est situé dans un quartier calme et sécurisé, près de bons restaurants, de boutiques et de lieux de vie nocturne animés.\nLes chambres sont dotées d'un mobilier artisanal, de lits queen-size de qualité et d'une télévision par câble. Les suites comprennent une baignoire spa et une kitchenette.\nLe restaurant et le bar-salon de l'établissement servent une variété de boissons, de petits-déjeuners, de plats péruviens, de cafés et de desserts.",
        "description_en": "Hotel Antigua Miraflores offers free Wi-Fi, free parking nearby the Love Park and Miraflores Central Park with its nightly folklore shows. It is nearby Waikiki Beach, along the South Pacific Ocean.\nHotel Antigua is situated in a quiet and secure area, close to fine restaurants, shopping and a lively nightlife.\nAll rooms include hand-crafted furniture, quality queen size beds, and cable TV. The suites include spa baths and kitchenettes.\nA variety of beverages, breakfast options, Peruvian dishes, coffee and desserts are served at the hotel’s restaurant and lounge bar.\nGuests can make use of on-site services that include a tour desk, money exchange, art sales, laundry, luggage storage, and airport transfers.\nCouples particularly like the location — they rated it 9.6 for a two-person trip.",
        "description_es": "El Hotel Antigua Miraflores ofrece conexión WiFi y aparcamiento gratuito cerca del Parque del Amor y del Parque Central de Miraflores, con sus espectáculos folclóricos nocturnos. Está cerca de la playa de Waikiki, en la costa del Pacífico Sur.\nEl Hotel Antigua está situado en una zona tranquila y segura, cerca de restaurantes, tiendas y animados locales de ocio nocturno.\nTodas las habitaciones incluyen muebles hechos a mano, cama grande de calidad y TV por cable. Las suites cuentan con bañera de hidromasaje y zona de cocina.\nEl restaurante y bar salón del hotel sirve una gran variedad de bebidas, distintos desayunos, platos peruanos, café y dulces.",
        "description_pt": "Hotel Antigua Miraflores offers free Wi-Fi, free parking nearby the Love Park and Miraflores Central Park with its nightly folklore shows. It is nearby Waikiki Beach, along the South Pacific Ocean.\nHotel Antigua is situated in a quiet and secure area, close to fine restaurants, shopping and a lively nightlife.\nAll rooms include hand-crafted furniture, quality queen size beds, and cable TV. The suites include spa baths and kitchenettes.\nA variety of beverages, breakfast options, Peruvian dishes, coffee and desserts are served at the hotel’s restaurant and lounge bar.\nGuests can make use of on-site services that include a tour desk, money exchange, art sales, laundry, luggage storage, and airport transfers.",
        "description_it": "Situato vicino alla spiaggia di Waikiki, lungo la costa del Pacifico meridionale, l'Hotel Antigua Miraflores vi offre il WiFi in omaggio e l'accesso a un parcheggio senza costi aggiuntivi nei pressi del Parque del Amor e del Parque Central di Miraflores, con i suoi spettacoli serali di folklore.\nScegliendo l'Hotel Antigua alloggerete in una zona tranquilla e sicura, caratterizzata da una vivace vita notturna e da negozi e ottimi ristoranti.\nIn ogni camera troverete mobili artigianali, letti queen-size di qualità e TV via cavo. Tutte le suite presentano anche un angolo cottura e una vasca da bagno con idromassaggio.\nPresso il ristorante e il lounge-bar dell'hotel gusterete numerose bevande, proposte per la colazione, piatti peruviani, caffè e dessert.",
